        "video-only both fall below the best constant predictor, which scores 62.10."),
    "MOSEI (measured here)": ("MOSEI", E,
        "Accuracy H with the fusion style chosen on held-out data: +0.68, bootstrap 95% interval "
        "[+0.55, +0.82], permutation p < 0.001, d_z = 2.11, over 20 paired seeds (early "
        "concatenation). Mid fusion ties with it on held-out accuracy (71.23 vs 71.31) and gives "
        "+0.37. Late averaging has the best test accuracy (+1.43) but the lowest held-out accuracy. "
        "At 5 seeds the selection had chosen mid fusion and given +0.29. Best constant predictor "
        "scores 49.09."),
}
for e in data["entries"]:
    if e["corpus"] in vals:
        corpus, fused_key, note = vals[e["corpus"]]
        runs = R[corpus]
        e["modalities"] = {m: round(runs[m]["acc"]["mean"] * 100, 4) for m in ("text", "audio", "video")}
        e["fused"] = round(runs[fused_key]["acc"]["mean"] * 100, 4)
        e["note"] = note
        e["protocol"] = e["protocol"].replace("5 seeds", "20 seeds")
        h = e["fused"] - max(e["modalities"].values())
        print(e["corpus"], e["modalities"], e["fused"], "H", f"{h:+.4f}", f"{h:+.2f}")
